            "When their map was finished, it showed a complete, accurate picture of their neighbourhood: the market, the clinic, the library, and the park, all in their correct places. Their teacher displayed the map proudly on the classroom wall. \"This map shows everything we've learned about our neighbourhood this term,\" said Nay Chi happily, looking at their finished work.",
