            "As they walked past a toy shop, Nay Chi saw a brightly coloured doll in the window. \"Can we buy that too?\" she asked, her eyes wide with excitement. Her mother smiled gently. \"That's a want, not a need. Let's finish buying what we truly need first.\"\n\n"
